about=intro('ABOUT CYBRANIX LLC','Founder-led.<br><em>Business-focused.</em>','Practical technology consulting that connects business priorities, people, and the work needed to move forward.')+f'<section class="section wrap about-grid"><div class="founder-panel"><span class="founder-monogram" aria-hidden="true">TI</span><h2>Theo Ilevbare</h2><p>Founder · CYBRANIX LLC</p><p>A direct point of contact for the agreed engagement.</p></div><div><p class="eyebrow">OUR APPROACH</p><h2>Make the work clear<br>and the output useful.</h2><p class="large-copy">CYBRANIX works with organizations across sizes and sectors to bring structure to technology decisions and change.</p><p>Theo’s background spans IT operations, technical support, project coordination, and teaching. That perspective shapes an approach centered on clear requirements, usable documentation, practical training, and coordinated delivery.</p><p>Whether you need a focused review or support coordinating a broader initiative, the starting point is the same: understand the challenge and agree on what useful progress looks like.</p><div class="principles"><div><strong>Business needs first</strong><p>Connect the technology discussion to your goals and operating environment.</p></div><div><strong>Defined scope and responsibilities</strong><p>Agree the deliverables, ownership, timing, and fees before work starts.</p></div><div><strong>Knowledge that stays with you</strong><p>Leave your team with plans, decisions, documentation, and reference materials they can use.</p></div></div></div></section>'+ending()
