contact=intro('CONTACT','Let’s put your next<br><em>priority in focus.</em>','Tell us about your organization, the challenge, and what you want to improve. Use an introductory call to explore fit and a practical starting point.')+f'''<section class="section wrap detail-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">BOOK AN INTRODUCTORY CALL</p><h2>Start the conversation.</h2><p>Send an email to request a time. Include a brief description of your needs and a few suitable times with your time zone.</p><a class="button primary" href="mailto:{EMAIL}?subject=Introductory%20call%20request">Book an Introductory Call <span aria-hidden="true">&gt;</span></a><p class="micro">Opens your email app to request a call. A meeting is confirmed after a time is agreed.</p><div class="contact-details"><a href="mailto:{EMAIL}">{EMAIL}</a><a href="tel:+17793791260">(779) 379-1260</a></div></div><aside class="deliverable-panel"><p class="eyebrow">HELPFUL TO INCLUDE</p><h3>A little context goes a long way.</h3>{listitems(['Your organization and role','The decision, project, or operational challenge','What you want to improve','Any important dates or constraints','Your preferred times and time zone'])}<p>For government inquiries, include the solicitation reference, specifications, and deadline where relevant.</p><p class="micro">For an initial inquiry, share a summary rather than passwords or confidential system records.</p></aside></section>'''
